load @term/mill/code/code/take/mint
  find take

load @term/mill/code/code/tool/flow/mint
  find flow

note <lower a `test <phrase>` block to the `test` meta object: its name is the phrase, its work is the body's flow wrapped as a task. `run` (in @term/seed/code/test) executes a list of these. No special compiler support: a milled `test` is an ordinary record the backend emits like any other.>

mint test
  case name
    site name
  case term
    site term
  case take
    site take
  case work, mint flow
    site work
  hook make
    make test
      bind name, read name
      bind term, read term
      bind take, read take
      bind work, read work
